1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,729 --> 00:00:09,698
Last time, we met the stave.

3
00:00:12,498 --> 00:00:16,420
Today we are going to
find out where notes live.

4
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:21,090
The stave has five lines.

5
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:24,240
The gaps between them are spaces.

6
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:28,201
Five lines, and four spaces!

7
00:00:30,501 --> 00:00:36,281
If the line goes right through the middle
of the note, the note is on a line.

8
00:00:37,581 --> 00:00:42,479
If the note sits snug between
two lines, it is in a space.

9
00:00:43,779 --> 00:00:45,054
Let's try!

10
00:00:45,554 --> 00:00:46,754
Line.

11
00:00:47,336 --> 00:00:48,536
Space.

12
00:00:48,979 --> 00:00:50,208
Space.

13
00:00:50,808 --> 00:00:52,008
Line.

14
00:00:52,251 --> 00:00:53,573
You've got it!

15
00:00:54,873 --> 00:00:56,334
Now it's your turn!

16
00:00:56,434 --> 00:01:02,632
Come and help the animals find their
homes in Line and Space Safari!

17
00:01:02,732 --> 00:01:05,122
See you for the next Nugget!

